Description: Tekne desktop (metapackage)
 Depends on every component of the Tekne desktop: herbstluftwm on XLibre,
 with polybar, rofi, dunst, PipeWire, NetworkManager, gnome-keyring and
 Tekne's default applications. See docs/desktop-stack.md in the Tekne
 repository for why each one was chosen.
